sor Elm's Pokemon, resurfaces throughout the adventure to challenge the player, and the criminal organization Team Rocket reappears with plans of its own. The player explores a world full of wild Pokemon while uncovering the region's secrets.", "summary": "Pokemon Crystal is an enhanced version of Pokemon Gold and Silver and a role-playing game played from a top-down perspective. As in the earlier versions, the player explores the Johto region, catches and trains Pokemon, and battles other Trainers in turn-based combat while earning Gym Badges and filling out the Pokedex. Crystal keeps the same core adventure while adding refinements, including the option to play as a female character and animated Pokemon sprites. It retains series staples such as a real-time clock, Pokemon breeding, and trading and battling with other games via a link connection.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pokemon-crystal-version", "videos": [{"id": 17172, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "aW_Yi54JEUk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aW_Yi54JEUk", "title": "Pok\u00e9mon Crystal - Announcement Trailer - Nintendo 3DS", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aW_Yi54JEUk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 63347, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5cwfeSomfuw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5cwfeSomfuw", "title": "Pokemon Crystal JPN Commercial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5cwfeSomfuw/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 70327, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "V0sQ_NgubGc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V0sQ_NgubGc", "title": "Pok\u00e9mon Crystal - commercial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V0sQ_NgubGc/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 314, "name": "Pok\u00e9mon"}]}